    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-badin-hydractinia-stolon-vascular-net-repro-package> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Buss, Anderson & Perry (2015) Biol. Bull., Dudgeon et al. (1999) Am. Nat. & Blackstone (1999) Syst. Biol. colonial hydroid pulsatile gastrovascular stolon network, anastomosis loop closure, and runner-to-sheet morphospace — Reproducibility package: 93/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "8-suite `self_test()` (`L911-965`) verifying SHA-256 dataset integrity, Hagen-Poiseuille Kirchhoff conservation (< 1e-11), flux antisymmetry (< 1e-14), and cubic shear identity (< 1e-12), runner-to-sheet continuum & 2,4-DNP shift, MgCl2 polyp-arrest ablation control, 8-point pump-amplitude sweep, Euler cyclomatic loop identity, specimen CV segmentation, and bitwise determinism." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-repro-package> ;
